@ 0 15 0 033b87fa8fbf52c3191ecc558826aadf
+           column  Cas
+           column  Code
+           column  Message
+           column  Remarque
+           row  `DuplicateEntry(path)`  1  _the path `path` is a duplicate entry_  refusé avant la sérialisation du moindre octet
+           row  `NotFound(path)`  2  _path `path` was not found in the ZIP file_
+           row  `InvalidName(name)`  3  _the name `name` is not valid for a ZIP entry_  pas un `Path on Zip` valide
+           row  `UnsupportedMethod(method)`  4  _the compression method `method` is not supported_  tout sauf stored ou deflate
+           row  `MissingEocd`  5  _no end-of-central-directory record could be found_  les octets ne sont donc pas une archive ZIP
+           row  `TruncatedArchive`  6  _the ZIP archive ended unexpectedly_
+           row  `BadSignature(expected)`  7  _an expected record signature (`expected`) was absent_
+           row  `Zip64Error`  8  _the ZIP64 metadata could not be interpreted_
+           row  `WriteUnsupported`  9  _ZIP archives cannot yet be opened for writing_  une archive ouverte dans un mode comportant `Write`
+           row  `AlreadyExists`  10  _an archive already exists at this path_
+           row  `CannotWrite(detail)`  11  _the archive could not be written: `detail`_

